# CODEOWNERS
#
# Note: an organization handle (`@sourcesmithorg`) is NOT a valid owner.
# GitHub accepts only a user handle (`@rizperdana`) or an org team
# (`@org/team-name`). A bare org handle is silently ignored — it matches
# nobody and provides zero review enforcement.

# Default-owner only until the team grows.
#
# The verified maintainer account `@rizperdana` owns everything; it is
# confirmed from commit history. When the org grows, create teams and
# substitute `@sourcesmithorg/<team>`, then split these by path.

* @rizperdana

# Delivered reference material — read-only, must never be edited. Listed
# explicitly so any change here gets immediate human attention; CI also
# rejects PRs touching these paths.
/.docs/ @rizperdana
